{
  "slug": "hk-skills",
  "name": "Hk Skills",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Real-time Hong Kong weather data from HK Observatory. Supports English, Traditional & Simplified Chinese with natural language queries.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `hk-aed-wait` (Fetch real-time A&E (Accident & Emergency) waiting times for Hong Kong public hospitals), `hk-holiday` (Fetch Hong Kong public holidays from the 1823 government calendar), `hk-kmb-eta` (Fetch real-time KMB bus arrival times in Hong Kong), `hk-planner` (Plan outings, day trips, and activities in Hong Kong by checking calendar availability, public holidays, and weather forecasts), `hk-tcsp-licence` (Search Hong Kong TCSP (Trust or Company Service Provider) licensees by name, licence number, or business address), `hk-weather` (Fetch real-time Hong Kong weather from the Observatory)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install hk-skills@claude-community` from `ke11/skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
